        <mxCell id="policy-info" value="&lt;b&gt;Policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tier: Premium &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; Threat intelligence: Deny &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; DNS proxy: Enabled &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; State: Succeeded&lt;br&gt;DNS servers: 10.0.4.10 &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; IDPS: Alert and deny (2 signature override(s)) &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; TLS inspection: Enabled (CA: fw-inspection-ca)&lt;br&gt;Directly used by firewalls: fw-hub&lt;br&gt;Inherited by policies: none&lt;br&gt;Parent policy: fwpolicy-base" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f8f9fa,#26282c);strokeColor=light-dark(#adb5bd,#4a4f57);fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#dcdde0);" vertex="1" parent="1">
