        <mxCell id="evaluation-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Evaluation order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rules are listed as evaluated: DNAT, then network, then application, each by group and collection priority.&lt;br&gt;Rules inherited from a parent policy come first. DNAT rules are not inherited.&lt;br&gt;Traffic matching no rule is denied, except to the platform FQDNs in Azure's built-in infrastructure rule collection. Neither is a rule in the policy." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f8f9fa,#26282c);strokeColor=light-dark(#adb5bd,#4a4f57);fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#dcdde0);" vertex="1" parent="1">
